# Append-only. One entry per design decision. Never edit past lines.

2026-09-07 | resolved | palette-role-assignment | color | AcuNova
  Kept: primary = #7e5c36 (deep bronze), accent = #a67c4e (light bronze).
  Reason: not taste — check_contrast.py --matrix showed white on #a67c4e is
  3.74:1, below the 4.5:1 AA floor for a button label. Every CTA on the site
  was failing. Promoted the already-legal deeper bronze to primary rather
  than inventing a hue. Verified 6.05:1.

2026-09-07 | resolved | no-serif | typography | AcuNova
  Rejected: Playfair Display / editorial serif (carried over from the
  HimVolt reference build).
  Kept: Outfit (display + UI) + Figtree (body) + Parisienne (one flourish).
  Reason: user explicitly rejected the reference build's look; the poster is
  a geometric-sans composition with no serif anywhere.

2026-09-07 | resolved | delete-inherited-assets | assets | AcuNova
  Kept: deleting all 100 HimVolt image/video/logo files rather than reusing.
