  himvolt". Originals remain in reference/ so nothing was lost.

2026-09-07 | resolved | honesty-gate-on-proof | content | AcuNova
  Rejected: rendering the poster's "4.6/5" and "50,000+ Happy Customers" in
  the TrustBar.
  Kept: gating the rating tile on site.metrics.verified (currently false), so
