2026-09-07 | pending-review | benefit-claim-wording | content | AcuNova
  Choice made without user sign-off: the poster's six icon labels
  ("Relieves Joint Pain", "Improves Blood Circulation") were rephrased as
  use-cases ("Joint and knee comfort", "Supports circulation").
  Reason: those are physiological claims for a device with no FDA/Health
